{
  "id": "E367",
  "title": "Did You Bring Your Umbrella?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-10-13",
  "synopsis": "Check out these four strange things about rain and umbrellas in this article.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1174/99502287fd224db3b76892b8dcbb01d9d5181e19.mp3?1569842953",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你带伞了吗?\n\n    关于下雨，经常会有一些奇怪的事情发生。下面这些事情，你遇到过吗？\n1.下雨的时候，你一定会忘记带伞。\n2.如果你带了伞，那么那一天一定不会下雨。\n3.如果你带了伞又没有下雨，那么你一定会弄丢你的伞。\n4.如果你买了一把新伞，那就一定不会下雨了。",
    "traditional": "你帶傘了嗎?\n\n    關於下雨，經常會有一些奇怪的事情發生。下面這些事情，你遇到過嗎？\n1.下雨的時候，你一定會忘記帶傘。\n2.如果你帶了傘，那麼那一天一定不會下雨。\n3.如果你帶了傘又沒有下雨，那麼你一定會弄丟你的傘。\n4.如果你買了一把新傘，那就一定不會下雨了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Did you bring your umbrella?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "关于下雨，经常会有一些奇怪的事情发生。下面这些事情，你遇到过吗？",
      "traditional": "關於下雨，經常會有一些奇怪的事情發生。下面這些事情，你遇到過嗎？",
      "pinyin": "guān yú xià yǔ jīng cháng huì yǒu yì xiē qí guài de shì qing fā shēng xià miàn zhè xiē shì qing nǐ yù dào guò ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Some strange things often happen when it comes to rain. Have you encountered these things below?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "1.下雨的时候，你一定会忘记带伞。",
      "traditional": "1.下雨的時候，你一定會忘記帶傘。",
      "pinyin": "1 xià yǔ de shí hou nǐ yí dìng huì wàng jì dài sǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "1. When it rains, you will definitely forget to bring an umbrella."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "2.如果你带了伞，那么那一天一定不会下雨。",
      "traditional": "2.如果你帶了傘，那麼那一天一定不會下雨。",
      "pinyin": "1 rú guǒ nǐ dài le sǎn nà me nà yì tiān yí dìng bú huì xià yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "2. If you brought an umbrella, then it definitely won’t rain that day."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "3.如果你带了伞又没有下雨，那么你一定会弄丢你的伞。",
      "traditional": "3.如果你帶了傘又沒有下雨，那麼你一定會弄丟你的傘。",
      "pinyin": "1 rú guǒ nǐ dài le sǎn yòu méi yǒu xià yǔ nà me nǐ yí dìng huì nòng diū nǐ de sǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "3. If you brought an umbrella and it doesn’t rain, then you will definitely lose your umbrella."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "4.如果你买了一把新伞，那就一定不会下雨了。",
      "traditional": "4.如果你買了一把新傘，那就一定不會下雨了。",
      "pinyin": "1 rú guǒ nǐ mǎi le yì bǎ xīn sǎn nà jiù yí dìng bú huì xià yǔ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "4. If you buy a new umbrella, then it definitely won’t rain."
    }
  ],
